              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕುಸ್ತಿ — kusti — \"wrestling\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಜಾತ್ರೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಕುಸ್ತಿ ಸ್ಪರ್ಧೆ ನಡೆಯಿತು. jātreyalli doḍḍa kusti spardhe naḍeyitu. A big wrestling contest was held at the fair."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕುಸ್ತಿಪಟು, a wrestler."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕುಸ್ತಿ (kusti) is usually traced to Persian kushtī, \"wrestling\", which is thought to have reached Kannada through Hindustani."
            }
          ]
        },
